  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your akasha hardens the body, mind, and soul.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Radiant Dawn Style, Diplomacy 13 ranks.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> As long as an ally is benefiting from temporary hit points granted by you, they gain a +2 bonus on saves and to AC, and a +10 bonus to all movement speeds. The bonus to saves and AC increases by +1 and the bonus to movement speeds increases by +5 at 15th level and every 5 levels thereafter.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/rajah#toc50\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
